# PlatformIO build output -- generated, large, never commit.
.pio/

# Secrets. Copy config.example.h to config.h and fill in (same rule as the rest
# of the fleet: credentials live on the device, never in git).
include/config.h

# Support-bundle auth token (R9). Copy support_token.example.h to support_token.h.
# Ships in the .bin but must never be in tracked source (this repo is GitHub-bound).
src/support_token.h

# Vendor doc/demo bundle + local reference notes: ~800MB of datasheets, LVGL
# build artifacts, tool zips and firmware .bin files. The ENTIRE folder is
# local-only and NEVER pushed (the fleet uplink is metered, and git would carry
# the blobs forever). Re-download from lcdwiki if a fresh checkout needs it; the
# facts worth keeping already live in README.md and docs/ARCHITECTURE.md.
reference/

# PlatformIO / editor IDE state -- settings travel in platformio.ini, not here
.vscode/

# ESP-IDF Component Manager manifest -- auto-generated next to main.cpp by the
# build; IDF version pinning lives in platformio.ini, so this is redundant.
src/idf_component.yml

# Stray Chromium/Electron Crashpad log -- dropped in when this was the CWD; not ours.
debug.log
